00:02:35,624 --> 00:02:38,234
Strengthening security on the school grounds?

96
00:02:38,574 --> 00:02:42,194
That's right. There are rumors of a pervert lurking about.

97
00:02:42,694 --> 00:02:48,144
Meanwhile, the kingdom is faced with the enormous problem that is the Ragnarok.

98
00:02:48,144 --> 00:02:49,364
The Ragnarok...

99
00:02:49,884 --> 00:02:55,244
<i>I intend to fight it for the
 sake of this new kingdom.</i><i></i>

100
00:02:57,244 --> 00:03:00,044
Defeating that man didn't make much difference, so don't blame yourself.

101
00:03:00,044 --> 00:03:05,184
I know another Drag-Knight who can stand against the Ragnarok.

102
00:03:05,184 --> 00:03:06,134
Who?

103
00:03:06,854 --> 00:03:08,744
Celistia Ralgris.

104
00:03:08,744 --> 00:03:12,994
A daughter of one of the Four Great Houses, and the strongest third-year student here.

105
00:03:12,994 --> 00:03:16,134
Yes. She'll be back from the capital soon.

106
00:03:16,134 --> 00:03:18,994
But if what I heard is correct...

107
00:03:18,994 --> 00:03:22,154
Yeah, she can't stand men.

108
00:03:22,604 --> 00:03:25,114
And I have to speak to her.

109
00:03:25,114 --> 00:03:27,244
Well, I'm sure you'll make due.

110
00:03:27,244 --> 00:03:27,954
But...

111
00:03:27,954 --> 00:03:32,514
Back to more pressing affairs, are you going to help us patrol the school grounds?

112
00:03:32,514 --> 00:03:35,764
Yes, of course. I'd be glad to help.

113
00:03:35,764 --> 00:03:36,814
Thank you.

114
00:03:36,814 --> 00:03:37,994
Then let's get down to business!

115
00:03:38,534 --> 00:03:39,284
Yes!

116
00:03:39,964 --> 00:03:41,964
Quickly, Shalice, do it!

117
00:03:42,474 --> 00:03:44,294
Accept your fate.

118
00:03:44,294 --> 00:03:46,794
The less you resist, the sooner it'll be over.

119
00:03:46,794 --> 00:03:49,054
What?! Are you going toâ

120
00:03:49,054 --> 00:03:49,654
Wait!

121
00:03:51,824 --> 00:03:54,924
Stop!

122
00:03:57,134 --> 00:04:01,684
I understand someone had to be bait,
 but I never expected this to happen to me.

123
00:04:02,294 --> 00:04:06,534
I wonder what kind of person she is,
 this so-called "strongest third-year student".

124
00:04:08,424 --> 00:04:12,904
I'm telling you, I was the one who volunteered to stay in the capital by myself.

125
00:04:12,904 --> 00:04:15,884
I don't mean to brag,
 but I think it was the right call.

126
00:04:14,854 --> 00:04:15,884
<i>Who could that be?</i>

127
00:04:17,994 --> 00:04:22,084
Still, I didn't really expect everyone to go back without me.

128
00:04:23,524 --> 00:04:26,794
No, I'm not at all bitter about it, of course.

129
00:04:26,794 --> 00:04:29,094
<i>She's talking to a cat?!</i>

130
00:04:30,564 --> 00:04:32,704
Please wait! I wasn't done talking yet!

131
00:04:32,704 --> 00:04:34,554
<i>And the cat ran away from her.</i>

132
00:04:34,554 --> 00:04:36,384
Wait! Please come back!

133
00:04:36,384 --> 00:04:38,324
<i>Who is she?</i>

134
00:04:40,884 --> 00:04:41,524
Huh?

135
00:04:47,784 --> 00:04:50,614
<i>Shit! This must be the suspicious guy!</i>

136
00:04:53,724 --> 00:04:55,664
I can't allow this.

137
00:04:55,664 --> 00:04:57,494
My judgment is to not allow it.

138
00:04:57,934 --> 00:05:00,854
I <i>will</i> allow you to drop your weapon and surrender.

139
00:05:00,854 --> 00:05:02,954
You have no right to refuse.

140
00:05:10,424 --> 00:05:11,294
Look out!

141
00:05:15,904 --> 00:05:17,064
Are you all right?

142
00:05:17,064 --> 00:05:18,814
I-I'm fine.

143
00:05:18,814 --> 00:05:20,404
What about you?

144
00:05:20,404 --> 00:05:21,564
I'm okay.

145
00:05:21,564 --> 00:05:23,044
Let's go to the infirmary.

146
00:05:26,164 --> 00:05:27,754
Take off your jacket.

147
00:05:27,754 --> 00:05:29,234
We must treat the wound hastily.

148
00:05:29,234 --> 00:05:32,234
U-Um... You see...

149
00:05:32,234 --> 00:05:35,704
<i>Uh, oh. I'm still dressed as a girl!</i>

150
00:05:35,704 --> 00:05:39,694
Hurry up. You don't want that to leave a scar, do you?

151
00:05:39,694 --> 00:05:42,554
Um... Could you do it from behind me?

152
00:05:44,384 --> 00:05:46,414
There. You should be fine now.

153
00:05:46,414 --> 00:05:47,944
Does it hurt?

154
00:05:47,944 --> 00:05:50,134
I'm fine. Thank you.

155
00:05:50,694 --> 00:05:53,014
You're pretty muscular.

156
00:05:53,014 --> 00:05:54,924
Do you practice with a sword often?

157
00:05:54,924 --> 00:05:56,474
Um... Well...

158
00:05:57,564 --> 00:05:59,354
Sorry. That was a rude thing to say to a girl.

159
00:05:59,354 --> 00:06:00,144
I don't mind.

160
00:06:00,764 --> 00:06:04,854
By the way, weren't you
 talking to a cat back there?

161
00:06:04,854 --> 00:06:07,064
D-Did you see that?!

162
00:06:07,064 --> 00:06:08,634
Please forget it!

163
00:06:08,634 --> 00:06:10,124
You must have been mistaken.

164
00:06:10,124 --> 00:06:11,774
I didn't mean it like that.

165
00:06:12,104 --> 00:06:18,094
It's not as though I have no one to talk to,
 or have no friends! No, nothing of the sort!

166
00:06:18,094 --> 00:06:19,844
A-All right.

167
00:06:21,924 --> 00:06:24,814
Wh-What's important is that your injury was not severe.

168
00:06:24,814 --> 00:06:27,224
But please don't be reckless.

169
00:06:27,224 --> 00:06:30,214
It's my duty to protect the younger girls.

170
00:06:31,634 --> 00:06:34,424
I'm glad you weren't hurt either.

171
00:06:37,284 --> 00:06:40,354
You certainly are a handful, aren't you?

172
00:06:50,354 --> 00:06:53,364
By the way, I haven't seen you here before.

173
00:06:53,364 --> 00:06:57,574
Um... My name is L-Luno.

174
00:06:57,574 --> 00:07:01,714
I'm Celistia Ralgris. You can call me Celis.

175
00:07:01,714 --> 00:07:06,544
Let's meet again some time.
 I've taken somewhat of a liking to you.

176
00:07:07,004 --> 00:07:08,654
<i>Celistia...</i>

177
00:07:08,654 --> 00:07:13,284
<i>So she's the strongest student in
 the school, and she can't stand men.</i>

178
00:07:13,284 --> 00:07:14,384
Lux.

179
00:07:14,384 --> 00:07:15,374
Lux!

180
00:07:16,354 --> 00:07:17,734
Oh, sorry.

181
00:07:17,734 --> 00:07:20,694
It's only noon. Are you tired already?

182
00:07:20,694 --> 00:07:23,724
No, it's just that I was patrolling the grounds last night.

183
00:07:23,724 --> 00:07:25,474
Oh, that's too bad.

184
00:07:25,914 --> 00:07:29,264
I wanted to help you with your studies again today.

185
00:07:29,264 --> 00:07:30,534
Krulcifer!

186
00:07:30,984 --> 00:07:35,854
Or maybe you'd prefer to take a break
 and go out into the city with me?

187
00:07:35,854 --> 00:07:37,824
N-No, I'm stillâ

188
00:07:37,824 --> 00:07:40,614
Hey! Why are you still flirting?!

189
00:07:40,614 --> 00:07:43,094
I thought that "pretend dating" thing was over!

190
00:07:43,094 --> 00:07:44,854
Oh, was it?

191
00:07:44,854 --> 00:07:46,794
Don't play dumb! Get your hands off of him!

192
00:07:46,794 --> 00:07:50,124
What about you? Can't you tell you're squeezing Lux too hard?

193
00:07:50,124 --> 00:07:53,434
Can't <i>you</i> tell that you're bothering Lux?!

194
00:07:52,264 --> 00:07:55,764
Um... Everyone's staring at us, you know.

195
00:07:53,434 --> 00:07:56,254
My, my. Is the princess afraid to face reality?

196
00:07:56,254 --> 00:07:57,424
What?!

197
00:08:08,754 --> 00:08:09,434
It's you!

198
00:08:10,044 --> 00:08:11,614
You came to get me out of here, right?

199
00:08:11,614 --> 00:08:13,274
My sword friend!

200
00:08:13,954 --> 00:08:17,624
Trust me. I won't let that brat beat me again.

201
00:08:17,624 --> 00:08:21,904
I'll use all the assets at my disposal to buy new armaments through you.

202
00:08:21,904 --> 00:08:22,854
And thenâ

203
00:08:32,044 --> 00:08:33,904
Huh? What are you doing?

204
00:08:39,404 --> 00:08:40,364
Why?!

205
00:08:40,364 --> 00:08:41,844
Why do you forsake me?!

206
00:08:42,234 --> 00:08:44,514
You put that Ragnarok seed in me!

207
00:09:03,714 --> 00:09:04,934
<i>I've made up my mind.</i>

208
00:09:04,934 --> 00:09:10,504
<i>I have to try talking to Celis about the Ragnarok as well.</i>

209
00:09:12,544 --> 00:09:14,244
Luxy, there's trouble!

210
00:09:15,514 --> 00:09:18,854
I'm telling you, there's no reason Lux can't attend this school!

211
00:09:18,854 --> 00:09:21,254
We can't expel him now!

212
00:09:21,254 --> 00:09:22,444
Tillfur!

213
00:09:22,444 --> 00:09:23,414
I brought him!

214
00:09:23,414 --> 00:09:25,334
All right. Everyone, clear a path!

215
00:09:25,334 --> 00:09:28,254
It was decided during my absence.

216
00:09:28,254 --> 00:09:32,434
Making an exception undermines everything this school stands for.

217
00:09:32,434 --> 00:09:34,434
How stubborn can you get?!

218
00:09:34,434 --> 00:09:35,644
Excuse me!

219
00:09:36,214 --> 00:09:37,354
Lux.

220
00:09:38,244 --> 00:09:40,314
So you are Lux Arcadia.

221
00:09:40,714 --> 00:09:43,784
This is the first we've met.
 My name is Celistia Ralgris.

222
00:09:43,784 --> 00:09:46,284
Y-Yes. Nice to meet you.

223
00:09:47,734 --> 00:09:52,934
I'm grateful to you for saving the school
 in a moment of need during my absence.

224
00:09:52,934 --> 00:09:57,464
However, as you are a man,
 this is no place for you.

225
00:09:57,464 --> 00:10:01,754
Wait! Without Lux here how are we going to face the Abysses and the rebel army?

226
00:10:01,754 --> 00:10:03,034
Not an issue.

227
00:10:03,034 --> 00:10:05,944
I can handle a dangerous mission like that alone.

228
00:10:05,944 --> 00:10:08,934
There is no need to seek the assistance of a man.

229
00:10:08,934 --> 00:10:10,334
Please wait!

230
00:10:10,334 --> 00:10:12,814
I'd like to ask a favor of you
 concerning that matter.

231
00:10:12,814 --> 00:10:18,334
Allow me to participate in the subjugation of the
 Ragnarok that Lord Balzeride was to carry out.

232
00:10:18,334 --> 00:10:19,104
Lux?

233
00:10:19,544 --> 00:10:23,104
This a threat to the new kingdom.
 It is of no concern to you.

234
00:10:23,104 --> 00:10:26,424
If the Ragnarok revives, I'll fight it alone.

235
00:10:26,424 --> 00:10:29,574
In that case, I cannot leave this school yet.

236
00:10:29,974 --> 00:10:34,544
I'm aware of how strong you are,
 but the Ragnarok is a formidable enemy.

237
00:10:34,544 --> 00:10:37,504
I cannot allow you to face that danger by yourself!

238
00:10:38,914 --> 00:10:41,444
Were you not listening?

239
00:10:41,444 --> 00:10:43,544
I do not intend to allow yourâ

240
00:10:45,094 --> 00:10:47,384
Settle down a bit, you two.

241
00:10:47,754 --> 00:10:52,934
In summary, Lux wants to remain in the school and assist in the fight against the Ragnarok.

242
00:10:52,934 --> 00:10:53,954
That's right.

243
00:10:53,954 --> 00:10:59,484
And Celis wants Lux to
 leave the school, correct?

244
00:11:00,144 --> 00:11:03,634
But the opinions of the students
 are also divided.

245
00:11:03,634 --> 00:11:07,314
So how about you two fight it out?

246
00:11:07,314 --> 00:11:08,014
Huh?

247
00:11:08,014 --> 00:11:09,404
What are you saying?

248
00:11:09,784 --> 00:11:14,294
In three days, there will be a training camp
 of the knight squadron at Ries Island.

249
00:11:14,294 --> 00:11:19,624
I want you to decide whether to accept him
 after seeing Lux's skills and fighting him there.

250
00:11:21,014 --> 00:11:23,284
Or are you getting cold feet, earl's daughter?

251
00:11:23,284 --> 00:11:26,454
I am of course betting on Lux winning.

252
00:11:26,454 --> 00:11:27,594
Very well.

253
00:11:27,954 --> 00:11:29,834
Until we meet at Ries Island then.

254
00:11:29,834 --> 00:11:30,804
Excuse me.

255
00:11:31,544 --> 00:11:34,764
Do not think you can defeat me.

256
00:11:34,764 --> 00:11:35,764
Celis!

257
00:11:36,684 --> 00:11:38,464
Let's go, Saniya.

258
00:11:53,704 --> 00:11:54,744
Celis.

259
00:11:55,344 --> 00:11:57,894
Thank you for what you did today.

260
00:11:57,894 --> 00:12:02,964
You negotiated his expulsion in order to restore the spirit of the school.

261
00:12:03,604 --> 00:12:06,154
Don't worry yourself, Saniya.

262
00:12:06,154 --> 00:12:10,414
I share a desire with you to
 distance him from the fighting.

263
00:12:11,304 --> 00:12:14,894
As you say. Good night, Celis.

264
00:12:15,794 --> 00:12:17,374
This is fate.

265
00:12:17,374 --> 00:12:21,604
For him and me to have to fight like this.

266
00:12:21,604 --> 00:12:25,494
However, there is but one path before me.

267
00:12:25,494 --> 00:12:29,074
This is the only way I can protect both him and the school.

268
00:12:30,384 --> 00:12:34,074
I'm doing the right thing, aren't I, Mr. Wade?

269
00:12:42,484 --> 00:12:44,224
Everyone's off the ship, right?

270
00:12:44,224 --> 00:12:44,834
Yes, ma'am!

271
00:12:44,834 --> 00:12:47,194
Then let's begin training immediately.

272
00:12:47,194 --> 00:12:49,784
What? Training already?

273
00:12:49,784 --> 00:12:51,964
We should take it easy for the first day.

274
00:12:52,324 --> 00:12:54,114
We have a lighter program today.

275
00:12:54,114 --> 00:12:56,934
We did come for training, after all.

276
00:12:56,934 --> 00:12:59,144
Don't fall behind, Lux.

277
00:12:59,144 --> 00:13:02,374
That girl's "light program" is no joke.

278
00:13:02,374 --> 00:13:04,224
G-Got it.

279
00:13:09,154 --> 00:13:11,804
<i>That building there must beâ</i>

280
00:13:11,804 --> 00:13:15,684
Hey, Lux, quit daydreaming or you'll get left behind.

281
00:13:15,684 --> 00:13:16,784
Oh. Right!

282
00:13:18,574 --> 00:13:20,204
We'll start with a hundred swings.

283
00:13:20,564 --> 00:13:21,374
Yes, ma'am!

284
00:13:24,604 --> 00:13:25,594
Too soft!

285
00:13:25,594 --> 00:13:27,504
Step in harder!

286
00:13:27,504 --> 00:13:28,904
Yes, ma'am!

287
00:13:28,904 --> 00:13:30,044
Again!

288
00:13:32,504 --> 00:13:35,474
Man, I thought I'd drop dead right there.

289
00:13:37,084 --> 00:13:39,984
Yeah, but Celis sure is hardcore.

290
00:13:39,984 --> 00:13:42,684
She did twice as much of each exercise.

291
00:13:42,684 --> 00:13:45,644
Yes. That's just like her.

292
00:13:46,264 --> 00:13:48,654
She puts in double anyone else's effort like it's nothing.

293
00:13:48,654 --> 00:13:51,614
She's very diligent and strong.

294
00:13:51,614 --> 00:13:55,324
But it always looks like
 something is eating at her.

295
00:13:56,534 --> 00:13:58,784
I see.

296
00:13:59,244 --> 00:14:00,664
All right, then!

297
00:14:00,664 --> 00:14:02,374
Let's go back to our rooms and get some rest.

298
00:14:02,374 --> 00:14:03,834
Ah! Please wait a moment!

299
00:14:05,504 --> 00:14:08,714
I didn't get a chance to return the clothes you lent me.

300
00:14:08,714 --> 00:14:13,004
You're a real man of integrity,
 going as far as bringing them to the island.

301
00:14:13,004 --> 00:14:15,594
All right! I'll give them to you as a present.

302
00:14:15,594 --> 00:14:16,974
No, thank you!

303
00:14:17,344 --> 00:14:19,264
Jeez, you're no fun.

304
00:14:19,264 --> 00:14:21,974
Yes. I thought you looked very good in them.

305
00:14:21,974 --> 00:14:24,434
I never want to put them on again!

306
00:14:24,934 --> 00:14:29,064
You there, come with me. It's urgent.

307
00:14:29,064 --> 00:14:30,654
What? Me?

308
00:14:33,524 --> 00:14:37,034
Um, I was asked to give you a massage.

309
00:14:37,034 --> 00:14:38,244
Come in.

310
00:14:40,074 --> 00:14:41,744
Excuse me.

311
00:14:43,284 --> 00:14:45,994
<i>Naked?! Celis?!</i>

312
00:14:46,624 --> 00:14:47,964
Is something wrong?

313
00:14:47,964 --> 00:14:50,424
N-No, nothing at all.

314
00:14:51,004 --> 00:14:53,714
<i>Wh-Why is it her?</i>

315
00:14:53,714 --> 00:14:57,304
<i>She can't stand men.
 There's no way she asked for me.</i>

316
00:14:57,304 --> 00:14:59,514
Sorry to rush you, but could you start?

317
00:14:59,514 --> 00:15:00,184
Yes, of course.

318
00:15:04,054 --> 00:15:06,064
Thank you.

319
00:15:06,064 --> 00:15:09,354
I'd like to change. Could you turn on the lights?

320
00:15:09,354 --> 00:15:11,814
Um, I'll be leaving then.

321
00:15:11,814 --> 00:15:14,024
At least allow me to thank you first.

322
00:15:14,024 --> 00:15:15,444
P-Please wait!

323
00:15:15,444 --> 00:15:17,364
I need to prepare myself.

324
00:15:21,114 --> 00:15:22,204
Thank you.

325
00:15:23,414 --> 00:15:24,874
What's wrong?

326
00:15:24,874 --> 00:15:25,994
Um... well...

327
00:15:26,544 --> 00:15:28,954
Luno! It was you?

328
00:15:29,374 --> 00:15:31,584
It's nice to see you again.

329
00:15:31,584 --> 00:15:33,214
How's your wound?

330
00:15:33,214 --> 00:15:35,634
I didn't know you were here at the camp.

331
00:15:35,634 --> 00:15:37,924
Why don't you stay a bit so we can chat?

332
00:15:37,924 --> 00:15:42,384
U-Um, sorry but IâUh, I have something else I have to do.

333
00:15:44,684 --> 00:15:47,684
I see. That's a shame.

334
00:15:47,684 --> 00:15:52,854
Then would you join me
 during the break tomorrow?

335
00:15:52,854 --> 00:15:55,564
What? But I...

336
00:15:55,564 --> 00:15:58,324
I-I understand if you don't want to.

337
00:15:58,324 --> 00:16:02,784
Th-That's not it. Um, a-all right, I'll be there.

338
00:16:02,784 --> 00:16:05,204
Thank you, Luno!

339
00:16:05,204 --> 00:16:08,244
I'll wait for you in front of the
 boarding house after lunch tomorrow.

340
00:16:08,244 --> 00:16:08,994
O-Okay.

341
00:16:09,494 --> 00:16:11,004
I'll take my leave then.

342
00:16:11,004 --> 00:16:12,294
Ah, wait a moment.

343
00:16:12,294 --> 00:16:12,964
Huh?

344
00:16:13,544 --> 00:16:15,964
Did someone misplace this?

345
00:16:15,964 --> 00:16:17,794
No! Th-That's...

346
00:16:17,794 --> 00:16:19,174
Is it yours?

347
00:16:21,224 --> 00:16:23,384
It's a beautiful sword device.

348
00:16:25,094 --> 00:16:27,934
Here. Take good care of it.

349
00:16:27,934 --> 00:16:30,104
I will. Thank you.

350
00:16:32,104 --> 00:16:33,444
Good night.

351
00:16:35,904 --> 00:16:37,814
What are you doing here?

352
00:16:40,194 --> 00:16:41,534
I've never seen you before.

353
00:16:42,034 --> 00:16:44,244
Would you mind telling me
 exactly who you are?

354
00:16:45,164 --> 00:16:45,954
Um...

355
00:16:45,954 --> 00:16:47,914
There's no point trying to run.

356
00:16:47,914 --> 00:16:49,164
Wait a moment.

357
00:16:49,704 --> 00:16:52,204
Can you stop interrogating her?

358
00:16:52,204 --> 00:16:54,334
I need her for something.

359
00:16:55,674 --> 00:16:57,544
Krulcifer.

360
00:16:57,544 --> 00:17:00,804
It's rude of you to interrupt me.

361
00:17:01,174 --> 00:17:02,634
Are you not being rude yourself?

362
00:17:02,634 --> 00:17:06,344
You've been lurking in front of that room for a while now.

363
00:17:06,344 --> 00:17:09,014
Would you mind telling me what you were doing?

364
00:17:12,684 --> 00:17:13,934
Excuse me.

365
00:17:19,824 --> 00:17:21,904
Let's go, Lux.

366
00:17:21,904 --> 00:17:24,614
Thank you, Krulcifer.

367
00:17:24,614 --> 00:17:26,744
So you recognized me.

368
00:17:26,744 --> 00:17:28,374
Of course.

369
00:17:28,374 --> 00:17:32,164
How could I not recognize my dearest Lux?

370
00:17:32,914 --> 00:17:34,124
By the way, be very careful.

371
00:17:34,714 --> 00:17:42,554
That girl just now, Saniya Lemiste, is pushing Celis to have you expelled from the school.

372
00:18:01,364 --> 00:18:03,364
Good morning, Lu!

373
00:18:03,364 --> 00:18:04,614
P-Phi!

374
00:18:04,994 --> 00:18:08,534
Wait! This isn't the girls' dorm.
 It's a boarding house!

375
00:18:08,534 --> 00:18:10,124
Are you half asleep?!

376
00:18:11,244 --> 00:18:13,954
Lu, want a hug?

377
00:18:18,214 --> 00:18:21,214
If I do this, it'll cheer you up.

378
00:18:21,214 --> 00:18:24,054
Like when my mom did it for me.

379
00:18:25,514 --> 00:18:29,014
You don't have to. I'm not a kid any more.

380
00:18:29,014 --> 00:18:31,394
Have you changed, Lu?

381
00:18:31,394 --> 00:18:32,054
What?

382
00:18:32,054 --> 00:18:35,224
You don't seem any different to me.

383
00:18:35,224 --> 00:18:39,394
I think you're the same kind Lu
 you were back then.

384
00:18:39,394 --> 00:18:40,484
Phi!

385
00:18:42,904 --> 00:18:44,324
It's okay.

386
00:18:44,324 --> 00:18:47,404
We haven't changed.

387
00:18:47,824 --> 00:18:52,744
If you lose, I'll fight Celis.

388
00:18:52,744 --> 00:18:56,374
I won't let them expel you.

389
00:18:58,584 --> 00:19:01,254
Thanks, Phi. I'll give it my all.

390
00:19:09,674 --> 00:19:10,974
Good morning.

391
00:19:11,844 --> 00:19:14,554
I'm looking forward to our time together, Luno.

392
00:19:15,064 --> 00:19:17,434
A-As am I.

393
00:19:18,104 --> 00:19:18,984
Let's go!

394
00:19:18,984 --> 00:19:19,814
Okay.

395
00:19:28,864 --> 00:19:34,454
Oh, I've heard that such clothes are in fashion now. Do you like them?

396
00:19:34,454 --> 00:19:36,204
I don't really follow fashion.

397
00:19:36,204 --> 00:19:37,914
I-I see.

398
00:19:38,294 --> 00:19:40,874
Oh, then what about that shop?

399
00:19:43,634 --> 00:19:46,134
<i></i><i>Th-This can't go well!</i><i></i><i></i>

400
00:19:47,424 --> 00:19:49,884
It's supposed to be a dress for sea bathing.

401
00:19:50,974 --> 00:19:53,014
Do you want to try one on too?

402
00:19:53,014 --> 00:19:55,264
Um... I...

403
00:19:55,264 --> 00:19:58,224
I think I have a bit of a cold.

404
00:20:01,104 --> 00:20:04,064
I'm sorry I didn't mean to force you.

405
00:20:04,064 --> 00:20:05,194
It's all right.

406
00:20:06,654 --> 00:20:10,694
I'm sorry. It appears I don't know
 how to properly treat younger students.

407
00:20:10,694 --> 00:20:11,154
What?

408
00:20:11,654 --> 00:20:14,284
I've failed at being a good upperclassman.

409
00:20:14,284 --> 00:20:17,414
Father will surely scold me for it. He'll hate me.

410
00:20:17,414 --> 00:20:20,664
Even though I'm the commander of the knight squadron, I...

411
00:20:20,664 --> 00:20:23,584
No, it's not like that.

412
00:20:23,584 --> 00:20:25,754
Really?

413
00:20:26,134 --> 00:20:31,134
Yes. I really enjoyed walking around with you.

414
00:20:32,594 --> 00:20:35,644
You're a kind girl, Luno.

415
00:20:35,644 --> 00:20:37,684
I deeply appreciate hearing that.

416
00:20:45,104 --> 00:20:48,064
These are very good, Celis.

417
00:20:57,664 --> 00:20:59,034
I...

418
00:20:59,034 --> 00:21:00,994
Don't worry about it.

419
00:21:00,994 --> 00:21:02,954
This is our time to relax.

420
00:21:02,954 --> 00:21:05,964
No! I'm the commander of the knight squadron.

421
00:21:05,964 --> 00:21:07,884
I can't show any weakness!

422
00:21:08,424 --> 00:21:10,884
Do you pretend to be perfect all the time?

423
00:21:11,764 --> 00:21:13,264
Listen up, Luno.

424
00:21:13,264 --> 00:21:16,724
A strong person is a person who can bear loneliness.

425
00:21:16,724 --> 00:21:18,604
So you don't need to worry about me.

426
00:21:21,474 --> 00:21:22,394
Luno?

427
00:21:22,394 --> 00:21:27,064
I'm sorry. I just remembered you talking to that cat.

428
00:21:27,064 --> 00:21:29,774
Y-You still remember that?!

429
00:21:30,194 --> 00:21:31,654
Please forget about it!

430
00:21:31,654 --> 00:21:39,034
It's not as though I harbored loneliness while alone in
 the capital for so long, which then suddenly exploded!

431
00:21:39,034 --> 00:21:41,954
You keep digging yourself into a deeper hole.

432
00:21:41,954 --> 00:21:43,754
It's so depressing.

433
00:21:43,754 --> 00:21:47,754
And for some reason people
 think that I can't stand men.

434
00:21:48,754 --> 00:21:51,214
Hold on a moment! What did you just say?

435
00:21:52,004 --> 00:21:55,674
Luno, can you keep a secret?

436
00:21:56,134 --> 00:21:56,634
Yes.

437
00:21:57,264 --> 00:21:59,054
I, um...

438
00:22:00,144 --> 00:22:02,604
I actually don't have anything against men.

